        description="Cross section width of the beam. Applied to all segments. A custom profile (profileId, or the profile the beam already has) sets the size itself and Archicad ignores the width: the item then fails with a message naming the profile, and the other given fields are still applied. Send buildingMaterialId in the same call to switch to a basic cross section first.",
